            GMC Launcher 1.2.5 - Stability &amp; Performance Update
        </title>

        <id>
            https://gmclauncher.org/news/release-1.2.5
        </id>

        <link href="https://gmclauncher.org/news/release-1.2.5"/>

        <updated>
            2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z
        </updated>


        <summary type="html">
            A major update focused on better performance, stability and new launcher features.
        </summary>


        <content type="html">

            <p>
                Hello GMC community!
            </p>

            <p>
                We are happy to announce the release of GMC Launcher 1.2.5!
                This update improves stability, speed and brings new features requested by our users.
            </p>


            <h2>
                ✨ Added
            </h2>

            <ul>

                <li>
                    New Community tab for servers, news and useful links.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Improved Modrinth integration.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Better launcher logs and debugging information.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Improved Java runtime detection.
                </li>

            </ul>


            <h2>
                ⚙ Changed
            </h2>

            <ul>

                <li>
                    Improved download system performance.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Updated internal components.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Improved user interface responsiveness.
                </li>

            </ul>


            <h2>
                🐛 Fixed
            </h2>

            <ul>

                <li>
                    Fixed several crashes and stability issues.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Fixed launcher cache problems.
                </li>

                <li>
                    Fixed various UI bugs.
                </li>

            </ul>


            <p>
                Thank you for using GMC Launcher!
                We appreciate every user and contributor who helps improve the project.
            </p>


            <p>
                See you in the next update! 🚀
            </p>


        </content>


        <author>
            <name>
                Dev_Morgan
            </name>
        </author>


    </entry>



